## DO'S AND DON'Ts

### DO:
✅ Complete Tier 1 fully before Tier 2
✅ Space learning over multiple days
✅ Trace examples carefully
✅ Answer all self-assessment questions
✅ Practice 5+ problems per pattern
✅ Sleep between learning days
✅ Review after 2 days
✅ Move to Tier 2 after Tier 1 mastery

### DON'T:
❌ Skip Tier 1 (it's essential!)
❌ Rush through patterns (90 min minimum)
❌ Cram all patterns in one day
❌ Skip examples and visualizations
❌ Skip self-assessment questions
❌ Learn Tier 2 before Tier 1 mastery
❌ Learn Tier 3 before non-linear structures
❌ Skip practice problems

### CAN:
✅ Do Tier 2 and non-linear structures partially in parallel
✅ Do Tier 3 anytime after Week 6
✅ Prioritize Tier 2 patterns by interest
✅ Practice more than 5-7 problems per pattern

