## FINAL NOTES

### Why This Tier System?
- **Not all patterns equally important**: Tier 1 used 70%+ of time
- **Foundation required**: Can't learn advanced before basics
- **Cognitive load management**: Space learning over time
- **Pattern synergy**: Each tier builds on previous
- **Interview readiness**: Progressive coverage increase

### Why This Schedule?
- **Intensive Week 4.5**: Foundation is critical
- **Measured Tier 2**: Important but less critical than Tier 1
- **Flexible Tier 3**: Can do anytime, optional depth
- **Non-linear structures**: Different paradigm, requires fresh learning
- **Advanced algorithms**: Build on complete foundation

### Expected Outcomes:
- ✅ 70-80% interview coverage after Week 4.5
- ✅ 80-88% interview coverage after Week 5.5
- ✅ 85-95% interview coverage after Week 6.5
- ✅ 90%+ interview coverage after Weeks 7-12

